WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:05.880
Speaker 1: We have major controversial vaccine
news from the state of California, which has

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:14.410
announced that California will require eligible
students in public and private schools to

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:16.870
be vaccinated against COVID 19.

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:20.130
Now the real headline should be.

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:26.430
California will require eligible students
in public and private schools to be vaccinated

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:28.320
against COVID 19.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:33.079
In addition to all the other vaccines that
California students in public and private

00:00:33.079 --> 00:00:37.399
schools already have to be vaccinated against
that because that's really what this is.

00:00:37.399 --> 00:00:42.140
California already has a long list of requirements,
and importantly, they apply to private schools

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:43.140
as well.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:47.710
Looking at an article from ABC7, California
will soon require all students in both public

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:52.839
and private schools to get the COVID vaccine
once it's authorized by the FDA for different

00:00:52.839 --> 00:00:54.409
age groups.

00:00:54.409 --> 00:00:58.979
Gavin Newsom announced the emergency order
Friday while visiting a middle school in San

00:00:58.979 --> 00:00:59.979
Francisco.

00:00:59.979 --> 00:01:03.460
The COVID vaccine will now join the list of
10 other vaccinations required for children

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:05.440
to attend school in the state.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:09.550
The governor said the state will issue the
mandate in the next school term following

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:11.250
the FDA's approval.

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:16.590
The earliest being Jan. one 22 and the latest
being July one of 2022.

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:21.290
The government has fully approved the vaccine
for those 16+, but only emergency use for

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:22.890
12 to 15.

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:26.980
Once that group is fully approved, the state
will require students in seven through 12th

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:29.630
grades to get vaccinated.

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:32.850
California will require it for students in
kindergarten through sixth grade.

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:35.600
After that approval takes place.

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:39.610
At the same time, staff members at all state
schools will need to be fully vaccinated.

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:42.740
The state issued a mandate in August for teachers
and school staff.

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:45.360
Now it has eliminated the option to do regular
testing.

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:48.670
Instead of getting the vaccine, you just got
to get the vaccine.

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:52.550
Students would be granted religious and medical
exemptions, but the rules for how to split

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:53.550
the state would apply.

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:55.680
Them have not yet been written.

00:01:55.680 --> 00:02:01.320
Any student who refuses to take the vaccine
will be forced to do independent study courses

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.210
at home.

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:07.520
Very important in California.

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:12.730
It also applies to charter schools, and it
also applies to private schools.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:16.470
Charter and private schools are held to the
same standards and same curriculum requirements,

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:18.480
and it applies to vaccines as well.

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:19.730
That's not the case in all states.

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:22.380
That's how California is organized.

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:26.590
California already requires 10 vaccines to
go to school.

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:30.100
There are some anti-vaxxers who complain about
that, but not many.

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:36.080
So this is relatively uncontroversial, and
once you understand existing California law

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:38.260
with regard to vaccination and exemptions.

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:42.980
California has also really tamped down on
religious exemptions for vaccinations.

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:47.210
Medical is one thing, but religious they've
very much tamp down on.

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:52.370
You realize that there is really not much
controversy here relative to the existing

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:53.370
California law.

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:57.340
Now, if you live in a state that has completely
different laws, what's happening in California

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:58.800
might sound shocking.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:02:59.920
It still shouldn't be.

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:02.890
It might be very much incongruous with what's
happening in your state.

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:08.410
But for California law, completely normal
expected, and we're going to be hearing more

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.129
about it very soon

